        {"zh": "我要咬穿你的胸膛！", "en": "Pierce your chest!"},
        {"zh": "蛛丝收紧，骨头会响。", "en": "Tighten the silk and the bones creak."},
        {"zh": "我要咬破你的肚子！", "en": "Lift your belly!"},
