        {"zh": "你抬手时，网就收紧。", "en": "Raise your arm and the web tightens."},
        {"zh": "我的血鬼术从指尖出来。", "en": "My Blood Demon Art comes from my fingertips."},
        {"zh": "我等你踩进最黏的那片。", "en": "I wait for you to step into the stickiest patch."}
